; [changed] card "home_guards(jap)" cost 105 lvl 1 | soldiers jap_charger_rifle x8, jap_charger_smg_type100 x4, jap_charger_smg_type100_44 x3 | tags infantry all inf_only 44 45 | units/jap/squads_44-45.set:4
{"home_guards(jap)" "This squad of 16 banzai chargers, all troops being skill 1, is only lightly armed and minimally trained. With only bolt-action rifles and a few grenades, they are not equipped for serious combat. However, you may find them useful in defensive roles and for securing ground you've taken. Under the right conditions, and with proper support, they can be an effective fighting force worthy of the Homeland."}
; [new] card "home_guards_throwgun(jap)" cost 105 lvl 1 | soldiers jap_charger_throwgun x15 | tags infantry all inf_only 44 45 | units/jap/squads_44-45.set:6
{"home_guards_throwgun(jap)" "This squad of 16 banzai chargers, all troops being skill 1, armed with ai friendly grenades and melee weapons. Best set to free move."}
; -- group squad_2 --
; [changed] card "smgs(jap)" cost 157 lvl 1 | soldiers jap_squadleader2, jap_rifle2 x3, jap_rifle2b, jap_smg2 x4, jap_smg2b x6 | tags infantry all inf_only 44 45 | units/jap/squads_44-45.set:10
{"smgs(jap)" "A squad of 15 troops with 2 skill, armed with rifles and submachine guns. These infantrymen are equipped to assault enemy positions. Their loadout also makes them ideal for close-quarter combat and urban fighting. They lack machine guns for suppressive fire, so it may be important to provide some additional fire support to cover their advance."}
; -- group squad_3 --
; [new] card "riflemans_t96(jap)" cost 163 lvl 1 | soldiers jap_squadleader, jap_rifle x3, jap_rifleb x4, jap_smgb x2, jap_mgun2, mgun2_asst, mgun2_ammo x3, jap_rifle_grenadier | tags infantry all inf_only 44 45 | units/jap/squads_44-45.set:14
{"riflemans_t96(jap)" "This squad of 15 soldiers with 2 skill are adept at both defense and assault. However, they are equipped with the less effective Type 96 LMG for their MG team."}
; [new] card "riflemans_t96_2(jap)" cost 145 lvl 1 | soldiers jap_squadleader, jap_rifle x3, jap_rifleb x4, jap_smgb x2, jap_mgun2, mgun2_asst, mgun2_ammo x3, jap_rifle_grenadier | tags infantry all inf_only 44 45 | units/jap/squads_44-45.set:15
{"riflemans_t96_2(jap)" "This squad of 15 soldiers with 2 skill are a balanced fighting force that combines rifles and other small arms, along with a light machine gun, to provide fire support. While they are equipped with the firepower necessary to advance upon the enemy, you may find that they are better served in a defensive role. The machine gun can suppress and splinter enemy infantry formations, while riflemen pick off their targets. This squad provides a solid backbone for any fighting force."}
